/err
# Test data generated or modified by tests and manual testing; committed structure is canonical
/fixtures/
/target

# AI assistant state
.opencode/

# AI agent instructions, local only. Named here as well as in the global
# ignore, which a session working from a fresh clone does not have.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md

# Agent skills are repo knowledge and are committed; the rest of .claude/ is not.
# The global ignore excludes .claude/ wholesale, and git cannot re-include a file
# whose parent directory is excluded, so the directory is re-included first.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
